        "original_id": "aec42de8-79a3-5e9b-b941-6e0f49b140b2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Silk\n- Events: Miracle on Ice, 1980 Winter Olympics men's ice hockey tournament\n- Places: Scituate, Cohasset, Massachusetts, Lake Placid, New York\n- Topics: American ice hockey\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Silk was born on January 1, 1958 in Scituate, Massachusetts.\n- Dave Silk was raised in Scituate and Cohasset, Massachusetts.\n- Dave Silk is a retired professional American ice hockey player.\n- The Miracle on Ice refers to a medal-round game in the men's ice hockey tournament at the 1980 Winter Olympics in Lake Placid, New York.\n- The Miracle on Ice game was played between the host United States team and the defending gold medalist Soviet Union team.",
